          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Yes. For entry-level roles in analytics and MIS, Power BI is enough. Gaining practical knowledge through real projects and improving communication skills opens up more placement opportunities.&quot;,
