          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;That's usually the smartest approach. Learning Power BI first builds strong analytics fundamentals. Once you understand reporting, dashboards, and data modeling, Tableau becomes easier to master.&quot;,
