          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;For many beginner and mid-level analytics roles, yes. Power BI is heavily used across Indian startups, IT companies, ecommerce brands, and consulting firms. Adding SQL, Excel, and basic Python skills creates stronger career opportunities.&quot;,
